# Untracked paths copied into each new git worktree.
# One path per line. Symlinks are skipped.

# Credentials — gitignored, but every worktree needs them to hit the live API.
.env
.env.local

# Spec Kit state (templates, scripts, constitution, feature specs).
# .specify/feature.json is gitignored on purpose: it is a per-checkout pointer
# to the active feature, so a copied one may name a feature this worktree has
# never seen. Re-run /speckit-specify or edit it if it looks wrong.
.specify
